// Himegari ADV prelude (spec §11.2): the scene library every ADV scene links, the dialogue line template and the
// speaker table. Drafted 2026-10-07 from the decompiled library of $1$SC1260 (the copies in 300+ scenes are
// identical) and CNINIT's speaker names; maintained by hand since.
module himegari.adv
use himegari.globals
use himegari.scripts

